#: batchop.rclearallconfirm
#, object-pascal-format
msgid ""
"Clear ALL translations in the following %d file(s)?\n"
"Headers are preserved, all msgstr values are removed.\n"
"This action cannot be undone within the application.\n"
"\n"
"%s"
